WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
ReadyDorm was built by five students for safer shared housing.

00:02.000 --> 00:05.000
The team used the report research: target segments, interviews, personas, user stories, and mobile UX flows.

00:05.000 --> 00:08.000
The implementation follows the challenge scope: HTML, CSS, JavaScript, GitFlow, README, and GitHub Pages.

00:08.000 --> 00:10.500
The final page is in English, responsive, accessible, and includes About the Product and About the Team videos.

00:10.500 --> 00:12.000
The product detail page keeps the extra modules visible without overloading the landing page.
